Some important considerations:

This is a simplified implementation. In a real application, you'd need to:

Handle proper authentication with the Taco Bell website/API
Implement proper HTML parsing of the menu
Add error handling and retries
Consider caching results to avoid unnecessary API calls
You'll need a Google API key with Places API enabled to use this application.

The checkForChilitoBurrito function is a placeholder - Taco Bell doesn't provide a public API for menus, so you'd need to either scrape their website or use a third-party food delivery API to get menu information.